 if she can learn to fly properly, but she quickly develops an interest in FC, and she, Misaki, and Mashiro, a freshman, join the school's tiny FC club, but Masaya seems reluctant for some reason, even though he seems to know a lot about the sport.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.3}],"value":6.3,"age":"PG-13"},"current_season_id":9153,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}